{"4516500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marque & Reprisal", "steam_appid": 4516500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5029880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Trade. Fish. Whale. Colonize. Fight. Pillage. Survive. You are a sea captain in the year 1522, and the whole world is yours to discover in this roguelike sandbox historical sailing simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Explore\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Marque &amp; Reprisal is a fully realized, 164k-hex map of the entire Earth, complete with accurate geography, navigable rivers and lakes, mountains, a detailed weather simulation, and many ancient and natural wonders to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Trade\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The cities and villages of the world buy and sell different goods at different prices, with supply and demand for goods and specie reacting dynamically to the actions of the player and the hundreds of NPC ships plying the trade routes in search of riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Fish\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish for many different species of fish! Upgrade your ship and your net to catch more fish, and sell them in the best markets to earn profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Whale\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The ocean contains great and mysterious beasts! There are multiple different whale species in the game, with ecologically accurate ranges and behaviours. Whales breed and have babies, and you can often see a whale calf following its mother through the ocean. Kill a whale with your harpoon and collect its valuable blubber to sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Colonize\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps on your journey you will meet colonists seeking passage to the New World. Help them and you may found new cities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Fight\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Do battle with pirates and hostile nations! Or become a pirate yourself and set out in search of rich merchant ships to seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Pillage\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a large enough warship, you can bombard a hostile city to silence its shore batteries, then land marines to capture the port!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Survive\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die in Marque &amp; Reprisal, there's no going back. You need to start a new voyage with a new captain. Death comes in many forms, from hunger and thirst to stormy seas and pirate attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Trade. Fish. Whale. Colonize. Fight. Pillage. Survive. You are a sea captain in the year 1522, and the whole world is yours to discover in this roguelike sandbox historical sailing simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Explore\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/76a1f197fc06830fbc7c3553fa4e6f78.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Marque &amp; Reprisal is a fully realized, 164k-hex map of the entire Earth, complete with accurate geography, navigable rivers and lakes, mountains, a detailed weather simulation, and many ancient and natural wonders to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Trade\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/f12546652433b6446eb8d25122b81714.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The cities and villages of the world buy and sell different goods at different prices, with supply and demand for goods and specie reacting dynamically to the actions of the player and the hundreds of NPC ships plying the trade routes in search of riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Fish\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/17ae6c7cbcfcf30c080887ce0fba8f45.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish for many different species of fish! Upgrade your ship and your net to catch more fish, and sell them in the best markets to earn profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Whale\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/514e7a1bbc7d899e3fab8851586b4501.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The ocean contains great and mysterious beasts! There are multiple different whale species in the game, with ecologically accurate ranges and behaviours. Whales breed and have babies, and you can often see a whale calf following its mother through the ocean. Kill a whale with your harpoon and collect its valuable blubber to sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Colonize\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b8a1cdbeffed15d7e756adb2095e4443.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps on your journey you will meet colonists seeking passage to the New World. Help them and you may found new cities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Fight\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/4dbe0f5c4a6df7ec5a313494361e91a7.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Do battle with pirates and hostile nations! Or become a pirate yourself and set out in search of rich merchant ships to seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Pillage\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/ea582d299b51f2aa21c8971d9a1bec9c.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a large enough warship, you can bombard a hostile city to silence its shore batteries, then land marines to capture the port!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.poster.avif?t=1786642049\" aria-label=\"Survive\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.webm?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/extras/b4840a15bfbbaae303d9fb631f6f7f93.mp4?t=1786642049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die in Marque &amp; Reprisal, there's no going back. You need to start a new voyage with a new captain. Death comes in many forms, from hunger and thirst to stormy seas and pirate attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore. Trade. Fish. Whale. Colonize. Fight. Pillage. Survive. You are a sea captain in the year 1522, and the whole world is yours to discover in this roguelike sandbox historical sailing simulator.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/e49a2665e828b10ec55741a0fd180675004fa486/header.jpg?t=1786642049", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516500/37146b4604ca8c84d9292cff30c34be3d2b37e